OL,3,GNEWSABy-election bill revealed after
OL,4,Arivals' cost row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of a by-election, triggered by
OL,7,Fthe resignation of a newly-elected
OL,8,Fcouncillor, amounted to more than
OL,9,F#17,000, it has been revealed.
OL,11,FVoters in South Tyneside Council's
OL,12,FHarton ward returned to the polls on 6
OL,13,FAugust, just three months after
OL,14,Felecting Alex Clarke on a night which
OL,15,Fsaw Reform UK take control of the
OL,16,Fborough.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
