OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABy-election bill revealed after
OL,4,Arivals' cost row
OL,5,
OL,6,FClarke resigned claiming the role had
OL,7,Fbeen mis-sold to him, but he was also
OL,8,Faccused of making a number of
OL,9,Fderogatory comments which were
OL,10,Fcondemned by local party leader Paul
OL,11,FMackings.
OL,13,FFollowing a Freedom of Information
OL,14,Frequest made after rival parties
OL,15,Fquestioned the cost of the by-election,
OL,16,Fthe council calculated the bill to be
OL,17,F#17,557.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
